#: ../../user_interface.rst:17
msgid "User Interface"
msgstr "Užívateľské rozhranie"

#: ../../user_interface.rst:19
msgid ""
"This section introduces the Kdenlive user interface (UI), explains the "
"various :ref:`elements <ui_elements>`, :ref:`icons <ui_elements-icons>` and :"
"ref:`buttons <ui_elements-icons>`, the :ref:`menu options <menu>`, the "
"default :ref:`keyboard shortcuts <ui-keyboard_shortcuts>` that can speed up "
"your editing work, and how you can :ref:`customize the layout <ui-"
"workspace_layouts>` to fit your specific post-production workflow."
msgstr ""
"Táto časť predstavuje používateľské rozhranie (UI) Kdenlive, vysvetľuje "
"rôzne :ref:`prvky <ui_elements>`, :ref:`ikony <ui_elements-icons>` a :ref:"
"`tlačidlá <ui_elements-icons>`, :ref:`možnosti ponuky <menu>`, predvolené :"
"ref:`klávesové skratky <ui-keyboard_shortcuts>`, ktoré môžu urýchliť vašu "
"prácu pri strihu, a ako môžete :ref:`prispôsobiť rozloženie <ui-"
"workspace_layouts>` tak, aby vyhovovalo vášmu konkrétnemu pracovnému postupu "
"pri postprodukcii."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:21
msgid ""
"After starting Kdenlive the window should look similar to the image below. "
"Kdenlive's user interface (UI) is consistent across all platforms, so it "
"doesn't matter whether your operating system is Linux, Windows or MacOS. Of "
"course, icons and text look different."
msgstr ""
"Po spustení Kdenlive by okno malo vyzerať podobne ako na obrázku nižšie. "
"Používateľské rozhranie (UI) Kdenlive je konzistentné naprieč všetkými "
"platformami, takže nezáleží na tom, či je váš operačný systém Linux, Windows "
"alebo MacOS. Samozrejme, ikony a text vyzerajú inak."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:23
msgid "The UI is separated into four main parts:"
msgstr "Používateľské rozhranie je rozdelené do štyroch hlavných častí:"

#: ../../user_interface.rst:25
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "[A] The Workspace with the various :term:`widgets<widget>` that can be "
#| "arranged to your needs. See the :ref:`view_menu` and :ref:`ui-"
#| "workspace_layouts` for more details."
msgid ""
"[A] The Workspace with the various :term:`widgets <widget>` that can be "
"arranged to your needs. See the :ref:`view_menu` and :ref:`ui-"
"workspace_layouts` for more details."
msgstr ""
"[A] Pracovná plocha s rôznymi :term:`panelmi<widget>`, ktoré možno "
"usporiadať podľa vašich potrieb. Ďalšie podrobnosti nájdete v časti :ref:"
"`view_menu` a :ref:`ui-workspace_layouts`."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:27
msgid ""
"[B] The Menu Bar with the :ref:`Menu <menu>` and list of :ref:`ui-"
"workspace_layouts`."
msgstr ""
"[B] Panel ponuky s :ref:`Ponukou <menu>` a zoznamom :ref:`ui-"
"workspace_layouts`."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:29
msgid ""
"[C] The :ref:`toolbars` below the menu bar and above the :ref:`timeline`."
msgstr ""
"[C] :ref:`Panely nástrojov <toolbars>` pod panelom ponuky a nad :ref:"
"`časovou osou <timeline>`."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:31
msgid "[D] The :ref:`status_bar` at the bottom of the screen."
msgstr "[D] :ref:`Stavový riadok <status_bar>` v dolnej časti obrazovky."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:36
msgid ""
"Kdenlive's default screen layout (example uses the Editing view): Menu Bar "
"(blue), Toolbars (yellow), Workspace (green) and Status Bar (red)."
msgstr ""
"Predvolené rozloženie obrazovky Kdenlive (príklad používa zobrazenie Strih): "
"Panel ponuky (modrý), Panely nástrojov (žlté), Pracovná plocha (zelená) a "
"Stavový riadok (červený)."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:41
msgid "Workspaces"
msgstr "Pracovné plochy"

#: ../../user_interface.rst:42
msgid ""
"The Workspace model follows the video editing workflow and can be adapted to "
"your individual style and preferences. By default, Kdenlive starts with the "
"Editing workspace model that looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"Model pracovnej plochy sleduje pracovný postup strihania videa a možno ho "
"prispôsobiť vášmu individuálnemu štýlu a preferenciám. Predvolene Kdenlive "
"začína s modelom pracovnej plochy Strih, ktorý vyzerá takto:"

#: ../../user_interface.rst:47
msgid "Kdenlive's default workspaces (example uses the Editing view)"
msgstr "Predvolené pracovné plochy Kdenlive (príklad používa zobrazenie Strih)"

#: ../../user_interface.rst:51
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This is where you keep your source files (video clips, images and image "
#| "sequences, title and color clips, animations, audio files). In this "
#| "screenshot the :term:`widgets<widget>` for :ref:`Undo History "
#| "<undo_history>`, :doc:`Compositions </compositing/compositions>`, and :"
#| "ref:`Effects <effects-effects_tab>` have been added to this section."
msgid ""
"This is where you keep your source files (video clips, images and image "
"sequences, title and color clips, animations, audio files). In this "
"screenshot the :term:`widgets <widget>` for :ref:`Undo History "
"<undo_history>`, :doc:`Compositions </compositing/compositions>`, and :ref:"
"`Effects <effects-effects_tab>` have been added to this section."
msgstr ""
"Tu uchovávate zdrojové súbory (video klipy, obrázky a obrazové sekvencie, "
"klipy titulkov a farieb, animácie, zvukové súbory). Na tomto snímku "
"obrazovky boli do tejto sekcie pridané :term:`panely<widget>` pre :ref:"
"`Históriu zmien <undo_history>`, :doc:`Kompozície </compositing/"
"compositions>` a :ref:`Efekty <effects-effects_tab>`."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:54
msgid ""
"This is where the clip selected in the project bin is displayed. In this "
"screenshot the widget for :term:`Library` has been added to this section. "
"See the chapter :ref:`ui-monitors_clip_monitor` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Tu sa zobrazuje klip vybraný v zásobníku projektu. Na tomto snímku obrazovky "
"bol do tejto sekcie pridaný panel pre :term:`Knižnicu <Library>`. Ďalšie "
"podrobnosti nájdete v kapitole :ref:`ui-monitors_clip_monitor`."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:57
msgid ""
"This is where the content of the :term:`timeline` is being displayed with "
"all effects and compositions applied. In this screenshot the widgets for :"
"ref:`Speech Editor <effects-speech_to_text>` and :doc:`Project Notes </"
"project_and_asset_management/project_notes>` have been added to this "
"section. See the chapter :ref:`ui-monitors_project_monitor` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Tu sa zobrazuje obsah :term:`časovej osi <timeline>` so všetkými použitými "
"efektmi a kompozíciami. Na tomto snímku obrazovky boli do tejto sekcie "
"pridané panely pre :ref:`Editor reči <effects-speech_to_text>` a :doc:"
"`Poznámky k projektu </project_and_asset_management/project_notes>`. Ďalšie "
"podrobnosti nájdete v kapitole :ref:`ui-monitors_project_monitor`."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:60
msgid ""
"Most of the action is taking place in the timeline. Here you put your "
"sources in the order in which they will appear in the final video, make "
"your :ref:`edits <editing>` (cuts and trimmings), :ref:`apply effects "
"<effects-apply_effects>`, add :doc:`compositions </compositing/"
"compositions>` and :doc:`transitions </compositing/transitions>`, and add "
"audio and sound tracks. See the chapter :ref:`timeline` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Väčšina činností prebieha na časovej osi. Tu zoraďujete zdroje v poradí, v "
"akom sa objavia vo finálnom videu, vykonávate :ref:`strih <editing>` (rezy a "
"orezy), :ref:`aplikujete efekty <effects-apply_effects>`, pridávate :doc:"
"`kompozície </compositing/compositions>` a :doc:`prechody </compositing/"
"transitions>` a pridávate zvukové stopy. Ďalšie podrobnosti nájdete v "
"kapitole :ref:`timeline`."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:63
msgid ""
"This is where you find all the tools you need to edit your video project. "
"See the chapter :ref:`timeline_toolbar3` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Tu nájdete všetky nástroje potrebné na úpravu vášho video projektu. Ďalšie "
"podrobnosti nájdete v kapitole :ref:`timeline_toolbar3`."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:66
msgid ""
"This section holds the :ref:`audio mixing panel <effects-audio_tools>` where "
"you control the volume and pan of the various audio tracks and the master."
msgstr ""
"Táto sekcia obsahuje :ref:`panel miešania zvuku <effects-audio_tools>`, kde "
"ovládate hlasitosť a panorámu rôznych zvukových stôp a hlavného výstupu."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:69
msgid ""
"At the top of the screen you have access to the menu (see :ref:`menubar` "
"and :ref:`Menu <menu>` for more details), the :ref:`ui-workspace_layouts` "
"and the :ref:`main_toolbar`. The menu bar can be switched on and off with :"
"kbd:`Ctrl+M`."
msgstr ""
"V hornej časti obrazovky máte prístup k ponuke (ďalšie podrobnosti nájdete v "
"časti :ref:`menubar` a :ref:`Ponuka <menu>`), k :ref:`ui-workspace_layouts` "
"a k :ref:`main_toolbar`. Panel ponuky možno zapínať a vypínať pomocou :kbd:"
"`Ctrl+M`."

#: ../../user_interface.rst:72
msgid ""
"Kdenlive displays context-specific information or hints on the left-hand "
"side of the status bar depending on where you hover the mouse pointer. In "
"the middle you see the names of the clips you hover over in the timeline. "
"This is also where error messages come up when working with clips in the "
"timeline. On the right-hand side Kdenlive displays the currently selected "
"timeline :ref:`edit tool <timeline_edit_tools>` and the icons to toggle "
"various timeline features. See the sections about :ref:`status bar icons "
"<ui_elements-status_bar_icons>` and the :ref:`status bar <status_toolbar>` "
"for more details."
msgstr ""
"Kdenlive zobrazuje kontextové informácie alebo rady na ľavej strane "
"stavového riadka v závislosti od toho, kde umiestnite ukazovateľ myši. V "
"strede vidíte názvy klipov, nad ktorými sa pohybujete na časovej osi. Tu sa "
"tiež zobrazujú chybové správy pri práci s klipmi na časovej osi. Na pravej "
"strane Kdenlive zobrazuje aktuálne vybraný :ref:`nástroj na úpravu "
"<timeline_edit_tools>` na časovej osi a ikony na prepínanie rôznych funkcií "
"časovej osi. Ďalšie podrobnosti nájdete v častiach o :ref:`ikonách stavového "
"riadka <ui_elements-status_bar_icons>` a :ref:`stavovom riadku "
"<status_toolbar>`."

